          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("We’ve been traveling for days upon days. Surely the Sceptre is getting close!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Yes, I feel it is near here. It calls out to be freed... it is near; very near! The Sceptre was forged here, not far where we now stand. The sheer power of it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("North and east. More than that, I cannot tell. Whatever beasts, monsters, and other denizens of the dark lurk ahead, I know that we shall prevail."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_54",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Delfador, you’ve told me the importance of the Sceptre of Fire. And I believe you! A powerful magical artifact, and the fabled symbol of the kings of Wesnoth. With the Sceptre in my hand even Asheviere would struggle to deny my claim to the throne."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Yet it pains me to know that while we delve deep under these mountains, countless people back home are suffering. Elves, men, dwarves; people we’ve missed out helping because we had to come here instead. I hope it’ll be worth it in the end."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_55",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Delfador... other than the prophecy about the Sceptre, you haven’t been keeping any other secrets from me “for my own good”, have you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("One. But I ask you to restrain your curiosity, for I hope it will never have to come to light. Here and now, we must focus on finding the Sceptre if you are ever to become king."),
          },
        ],
      },
