          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_ Near the chasm, the air almost crackled with magical energy. It also became steadily warmer. The floor was smooth and glassy in places, and a faint glow provided a small reprieve from the thick blackness. Volcanic fumes drifted up from cracks in the floor.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_ Distant rumbles and earthquakes made it difficult to keep steady footing. The very earth had come alive, heaving, struggling to be relieved of its centuries-old burden...</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "silence.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "fade_duration_remaining",
            value: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "while",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "condition",
                variable: "fade_duration_remaining",
                greater_than: 0,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "fade_duration_remaining",
                value: 5,
                mode: "sub",
              },
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "volume",
                value: 100,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: "$fade_duration_remaining",
                mode: "multiply",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: 0,
                mode: "divide",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: "$(100-$volume)",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:volume",
                music: "$volume",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:delay",
                time: 5,
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:volume",
            music: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We are here. The Sceptre... the earth... the fire... the air around us... everything! It calls out to be freed — I can barely hold it back in my mind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("On the contrary! My research leads me to believe that we stand in the center of a dormant volcano, which erupted centuries ago and buried the Sceptre in rock. It is indeed here, under the cave floor."),
          },
